          <div class="timeline">
            <div class="day-item open"><div class="day-header" style="cursor:pointer"><div class="day-title" style="font-size:14px">What does the 7-day holiday include?</div><i class="fas fa-chevron-down day-toggle"></i></div><div class="day-content"><p>Three nights at a 5-star Cairo hotel and three at a 5-star Hurghada resort, Cairo-Hurghada flights, meet-and-assist, entrance fees, private transport, a snorkeling excursion, a quad bike safari and an Egyptologist guide. International airfare, the visa and tips are extra.</p></div></div>
            <div class="day-item"><div class="day-header" style="cursor:pointer"><div class="day-title" style="font-size:14px">Why does the price start from $1,360?</div><i class="fas fa-chevron-down day-toggle"></i></div><div class="day-content"><p>$1,360 per person applies to groups of 9-16 travelers from May to September 2026. In the same season, 2-4 travelers pay $1,570 each and a solo traveler $2,330; spring, autumn and the Christmas-New Year period cost more — see the price table on this page.</p></div></div>
            <div class="day-item"><div class="day-header" style="cursor:pointer"><div class="day-title" style="font-size:14px">How is it different from the 6-day Cairo &amp; Hurghada package?</div><i class="fas fa-chevron-down day-toggle"></i></div><div class="day-content"><p>It adds a third night in Hurghada and includes a desert quad bike safari on top of the snorkeling trip. The Cairo sightseeing and the Nile dinner cruise on arrival are the same.</p></div></div>
            <div class="day-item"><div class="day-header" style="cursor:pointer"><div class="day-title" style="font-size:14px">Which meals are included?</div><i class="fas fa-chevron-down day-toggle"></i></div><div class="day-content"><p>Breakfast every day, lunch on the Cairo sightseeing days and the snorkeling day, the Nile dinner cruise on your first evening, and dinner on the safari day.</p></div></div>
            <div class="day-item"><div class="day-header" style="cursor:pointer"><div class="day-title" style="font-size:14px">Are the domestic flights included?</div><i class="fas fa-chevron-down day-toggle"></i></div><div class="day-content"><p>Yes. The flights from Cairo to Hurghada and back to Cairo for your departure are included, along with all airport transfers.</p></div></div>
